  "docs": [
    { "id": "doc-001", "title": "Q1 2026 Strategy", "content": "# Acme Technologies — Q1 2026 Strategy\n\n## Mission\nMake enterprise developer tooling seamless.\n\n## Strategic Pillars\n1. Enterprise PMF — ship auth, reduce onboarding friction\n2. Revenue growth — hit $5M ARR run rate\n3. Brand building — establish thought leadership\n4. Operational efficiency — control burn rate\n\n## Key Metrics\n- MRR: $267K (target: $417K by June)\n- Enterprise NPS: 42 (target: 50+)\n- Burn rate: $385K/mo (target: <$400K)\n- Headcount: 48 (no new hires planned Q1)", "owner": "alex-ceo", "last_modified": "2026-01-15", "shared_with": ["sarah-cmo", "david-cfo", "priya-product"] },
    { "id": "doc-002", "title": "Product Roadmap Q1-Q2 2026", "content": "# Product Roadmap\n\n## Q1 (In Progress)\n- Enterprise Auth System (SSO, SAML, SCIM) — ETA April 5\n- Self-Serve Onboarding Wizard — ETA April 15\n- API v3 Migration — ETA April 20\n\n## Q2 (Planned)\n- Advanced Analytics Dashboard\n- Team Collaboration Features\n- Marketplace for Extensions\n- Mobile App (Beta)\n\n## Backlog\n- AI-powered code suggestions\n- Custom workflow builder\n- Audit logging improvements", "owner": "priya-product", "last_modified": "2026-03-15", "shared_with": ["alex-ceo", "rachel-vpe", "ryan-pm"] },
    { "id": "doc-003", "title": "Marketing Plan 2026", "content": "# Marketing Plan 2026\n\n## Budget: $720K annually ($60K/month)\n\n## Channels\n- Content Marketing (40%): Blog, case studies, whitepapers\n- Paid Acquisition (30%): LinkedIn, Google Ads, dev community sponsorships\n- Events (20%): AcmeCon, conference sponsorships, meetups\n- PR/Comms (10%): Press releases, analyst briefings\n\n## Q1 Results\n- MQLs: 2,400 (target: 2,000) ✓\n- Blog posts: 8/12\n- Conference talks: 2/4\n- Community: 3,200/5,000 members", "owner": "sarah-cmo", "last_modified": "2026-03-20", "shared_with": ["alex-ceo", "james-growth"] },
    { "id": "doc-004", "title": "Series C Preparation Checklist", "content": "# Series C Prep\n\n## Financial Materials (David)\n- [ ] 3-year financial model\n- [ ] Cap table update\n- [x] Monthly financial statements (through Feb)\n- [ ] March financials (pending close)\n- [ ] Unit economics analysis\n\n## Data Room (David + Tom)\n- [x] Corporate docs\n- [x] Employee agreements\n- [ ] Customer contracts (top 10)\n- [ ] IP documentation\n\n## Narrative (Alex + Sarah)\n- [ ] Investor deck v1\n- [ ] Product demo video\n- [ ] Customer testimonials (3+)\n\n## Timeline\n- April: Finalize materials\n- May: Soft outreach to target funds\n- June-July: Formal process", "owner": "david-cfo", "last_modified": "2026-03-25", "shared_with": ["alex-ceo", "tom-controller"] }
  ],
